    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/630a5ef0e81e1dea2cedcec0/1nJpWm5L2XxDK7svPF9Hl.png) ⟨28⟩\nMeddies⟨28⟩\n/\nmeddies-asr-small-test⟨29⟩\nlike 1\nFollow\n![⟨30⟩] Meddies 16\nTasks:  Automatic Speech Recognition ⟨31⟩\nModalities:  Audio ⟨32⟩ Text ⟨33⟩\nFormats:  parquet ⟨34⟩\nLanguages:  Vietnamese ⟨35⟩\nSize:  < 1K ⟨36⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨37⟩ pandas ⟨38⟩ Polars ⟨39⟩ + 1\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Data Studio ⟨40⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨41⟩ Community ⟨42⟩\nDataset Viewer\n Auto-converted to Parquet⟨43⟩ API Embed  Duplicate⟨44⟩ Data Studio\nSubset (1)\nvi_faptv_human_gold · 20 rows\nvi_faptv_human_gold (20 rows)\nSplit (1)\ntest · 20 rows\ntest (20 rows)\nSQL\nConsole\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this split.\nParquet error: Scan size limit exceeded: attempted to read 381843958 bytes, limit is 300000000 bytes Make sure that 1. the Parquet files contain a page index to enable random access without loading entire row groups2. otherwise use smaller row-group sizes when serializing the Parquet files \n\n```\nError code:   TooBigContentError\n\n```\n\nNeed help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review how to configure the dataset viewer⟨45⟩, and open a discussion⟨46⟩ for direct support.\n  * Configs⟨47⟩\n  * Subset Status⟨48⟩\n  * Row Schema⟨49⟩\n  * Build Notes⟨50⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨51⟩ Meddies ASR Small Test \nSmall Vietnamese golden-test slice for ASR evaluation, packaged as Parquet with embedded audio in a `datasets.Audio` column.\n##   ⟨47⟩ Configs \n  * `vi_faptv_human_gold`: 20 FAPTV examples sourced from `Meddies/meddies-asr-human-labels`, clipped to the first 10 minutes of each original human-labeled episode.\n\n\n##   ⟨48⟩ Subset Status \n  * `vi_faptv_human_gold` is directly scorable.\n  * `text` and `reference_text` are identical and come from the clipped VTT transcript window.\n\n\n##   ⟨49⟩ Row Schema   \n| column  | meaning  |  \n| --- | --- |  \n| `audio`  | embedded 16 kHz mono WAV clip  |  \n| `text`  | primary transcript field for scoring  |  \n| `reference_text`  | explicit reference transcript  |  \n| `example_id`  | stable benchmark row id  |  \n|  `source_dataset`, `source_config`  | provenance back to the source human-label dataset  |  \n|  `title`, `youtube_video_id`, `youtube_url`  | original episode metadata  |  \n|  `clip_start_s`, `clip_end_s`  | clipped time window inside the original source  |  \n| `original_duration_s`  | full source episode duration before clipping  |  \n##   ⟨50⟩ Build Notes \n  * Selection is deterministic: the first 20 rows in local `processed-audios-wav/manifest.csv` with `duration_seconds >= 600`.\n  * Each row uses the `[0, 600)` second window when the source is at least 10 minutes long.\n  * Build metadata for this staged snapshot lives in `metadata/build_summary.json`.\n\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    103\nNumber of rows: 20 Total file size: 382 MB\n##  Collection including Meddies/meddies-asr-small-test\n#### Meddies ASR Collection Resources of Meddies ASR  • 9 items • Updated about 6 hours ago • 1 ⟨52⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨53⟩ Privacy⟨54⟩ About⟨55⟩ Careers⟨56⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
